WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.840
Pido disculpas por el retraso.

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:05.000
Everything will be resolved shortly.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.520
You will receive your purchased lot.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.640
Okay.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:11.760
Listen,

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:12.760
the cops are here,

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:14.080
right outside in the hallway.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.120
So?

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:16.720
They're asking about your paintings.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:17.600
What?

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.880
Listen, we have to move.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:19.280
Now.

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.160
No, Anthony.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.040
Listen, I'm not going anywhere, okay?

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:22.640
You will!

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.320
Miss Aspen,

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:26.920
please remain where you are.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:29.680
You are under arrest

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:31.560
on suspicion of involvement

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.400
in international drug trafficking.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:34.760
What?

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:36.240
What? Officer?

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.720
Listen, this is some kind of

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:38.520
misunderstanding.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:39.880
I'm sure of that.

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:41.040
Ma'am, please,

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:41.800
just keep your hands

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.320
where I can see them.

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:45.840
Officer, listen.

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:46.800
You got the wrong person.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.360
I'm telling you, she's innocent.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:50.200
Hey!

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.040
You can't just arrest people like that.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:53.280
Yes, we can.
